# description: Run `rake db:migrate` in a one-off dyno of app shop-api
POST /apps/shop-api/dynos HTTP/1.1
Host: api.heroku.com
Authorization: Bearer opf_heroku_EXAMPLE
Accept: application/vnd.heroku+json; version=3
Content-Type: application/json

{"command":"rake db:migrate","attach":false,"size":"standard-1x","type":"run"}
